OL,3,GNEWSAFoster carers retire after 30
OL,4,Ayears and 45 kids
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple are retiring from foster
OL,7,Fcaring after 30 years, during which
OL,8,Ftime they have helped offer a home to
OL,9,F45 children.
OL,11,FJacqui and Malcolm, from Gateshead,
OL,12,Fdecided to try fostering after their
OL,13,Fown children grew up and left home, and
OL,14,Fhave since provided short and long-term
OL,15,Fcare to children who needed a home.
OL,17,FJacqui was inspired to look into
OL,18,Fsigning up while working at Gateshead
OL,19,FCentral Library, where foster carers
OL,20,Fregularly held coffee mornings.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
