OL,3,GNEWSAFoster carers retire after 30
OL,4,Ayears and 45 kids
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said each child they cared for had
OL,7,Fa "different story", and revealed: "The
OL,8,Fmost rewarding thing is seeing the
OL,9,Fchildren gain our trust, overcome
OL,10,Fchallenges, build confidence and bloom
OL,11,F- each in their own way."
